Daniel Pall,

This communication serves as a formal and final rejection of the "NOTICE OF=
 PAYMENT DUE" and "NOTICE OF PAYMENT DUE_2.pdf" dated May 30, 2026. X-CEED =
Tech Solutions LLC has never authorized, signed, or executed any employment=
 agreement with you. The document titled "xceed_employment_agreement_daniel=
_pall_corrected_separate (1)_2.pdf" is a unilateral, unsigned draft that po=
ssesses no legal authority or binding effect on this company.



Your reliance on Discord messages as a "premise of payment" is invalidated =
by the very document you provided. Section XV of "xceed_employment_agreemen=
t_daniel_pall_corrected_separate (1)_2.pdf" explicitly states: "No verbal s=
tatement, silence, delay, continued work, staff title, Discord role, or inf=
ormal message shall waive Employee=E2=80=99s right to compensation, commiss=
ions, deferred compensation, hardship reserve balances, or equity unless th=
e waiver is in a separate written agreement signed by Employee". By includi=
ng this clause, you have legally disqualified the informal communications y=
ou are currently attempting to use as evidence. You cannot simultaneously a=
ssert the validity of an employment relationship while acknowledging that t=
he evidence you cite=E2=80=94informal Discord messages=E2=80=94is explicitl=
y excluded from creating or modifying financial obligations under the terms=
 of the document you drafted.



Furthermore, we are in possession of the "independent_contractor_agreement_=
daniel_pall_xerox_signature_ready_signed_signed (2)_2.pdf". This document c=
onfirms that effective May 25, 2026, you entered into a binding independent=
 contractor agreement with Matthew Shaw (Xerox) to perform technical servic=
es. Because your demand for payment covers the period from May 19 through M=
ay 29, 2026, you are attempting to invoice X-CEED Tech Solutions LLC for ti=
me that was already contractually committed to a separate client. You canno=
t legally assert a full-time, at-will employment relationship with X-CEED w=
hile operating as a signed independent contractor for another party during =
that same timeframe.



Your unauthorized acquisition and possession of our tax and filing document=
ation, combined with your attempt to manufacture an employment status throu=
gh contradictory documents and double-billing, constitutes fraud.

X-CEED Tech Solutions LLC will not process any payments, nor will we engage=
 in further discussions regarding your fabricated employment status. Consid=
er this a final notice to cease all attempts to solicit payment from this b=
usiness. Any further attempts to misrepresent your relationship with this c=
ompany or to utilize our business identity for your own financial gain will=
 be addressed as attempted fraud.

This matter is now closed.

X-CEED Tech Solutions LLC


